</li>
<li data-start="3795" data-end="3901">
<p data-start="3797" data-end="3901"><strong data-start="3797" data-end="3812">Social mode</strong>: If multiple people enter, it branches into more <em data-start="3862" data-end="3877">collaborative</em> or <em data-start="3881" data-end="3894">competitive</em> plots.</p>
