<hr data-start="1884" data-end="1887">
<h2 data-start="1889" data-end="1933">ğŸ§¬ Architecture (as a thought experiment)</h2>
<ul data-start="1935" data-end="2240">
<li data-start="1935" data-end="2018">
<p data-start="1937" data-end="2018"><strong data-start="1937" data-end="1946">Input</strong>: Any film â†’ ML model segments plot arcs, motifs, tone, character roles.</p>
