<hr data-start="2386" data-end="2389">
<h2 data-start="2391" data-end="2415">ğŸ§  The Deeper Premise</h2>
<blockquote data-start="2417" data-end="2487">
<p data-start="2419" data-end="2487">Youâ€™re not editing <em data-start="2438" data-end="2444">what</em> happened â€” youâ€™re editing <em data-start="2471" data-end="2476">how</em> it feels.*</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="2489" data-end="2597">Much like a dream, or memory: the events donâ€™t change, but the lens through which theyâ€™re <em data-start="2579" data-end="2591">remembered</em> does.</p>
